{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2026/07/15.html#a120316","date":1784116996000,"content":"There's a new Docs menu in <a href=\"https://rss.chat/\">rss.chat</a>. Right now it has pointers to the <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/rss.chat/\">home page</a> of our GitHub repo, and to the worknotes pages for the <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/rss.chat/blob/main/client/code/worknotes.md\">client</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/rss.chat/blob/main/server/code/worknotes.md\">server</a>. There will be lots more stuff in this menu as the project progresses.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"0f6a49dc3f7f1adb1a981474108a968cf7e64153296cd60044547d50889043af","category":"Sites"}